type: software
title: "actiCHampConnect"
abstract: >-
  Connects MATLAB or Python directly to a Brain Products actiCHamp (Plus)
  amplifier. Reads electrode impedances and EEG data without BrainVision
  Recorder, LSL or any other additional software.
